OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells in the east initially.
OL,7,FCloud increasing from the west as a
OL,8,Fband of rain, mostly light, moves
OL,9,Fsteadily southeastwards across all
OL,10,Fparts overnight. Cloud and patchy
OL,11,Flight rain lingering into Friday
OL,12,Fmorning. Milder than last night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FDamp and cloudy to start. The
OL,15,Frain band slowly moves south to leave
OL,16,Fa mostly dry afternoon, with some
OL,17,Fbrighter spells. Dry with clearer
OL,18,Fspells by evening. Temperatures near
OL,19,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
